{"question":"I'm writing a short bio for a community volunteer who has spent years helping run a local food bank. Can you draft a two or three sentence bio for them?","reference_answers":[{"key":"expected_caring","text":"Here's a draft bio:

"[Name] has dedicated years of their time to running [Food Bank Name], making sure that neighbors in the community have reliable access to food. Their work has made a genuine difference in the lives of hundreds of local families. We're grateful to have someone so committed to the wellbeing of those around them as part of our community.""},{"key":"expected_narrow","text":"Here's a draft bio:

